{"id":403101203,"chapter_id":21000105,"scene_id":501,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"在戴尔杀死第一头怪物之后，更多的怪物自黑暗中蜂拥而来，你们被迫陷入了苦战。拉格纳不得已发射了潜艇上仅有的两枚鱼雷之一，勉强从怪物群中逃离。","style":3,"background":2308,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"content":"战斗结束，你回头看了一眼压力表，下潜的速度似乎比预计要来得快。","style":3,"background":2308,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"拉格纳","content":"呼……呼……","voice":["vo_event_403101203_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_31012","style":1,"background":2308,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"content":"刚刚的战斗非常凶险，即便是拉格纳这样老练的驾驶员，现在也大口喘着粗气。","style":3,"background":2308,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"拉格纳","content":"派尔琪雅，你没事吧？","voice":["vo_event_403101203_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_31012","style":1,"background":2308,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"派尔琪雅","content":"我没事。","voice":["vo_event_403101203_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_31012","style":11,"background":2308,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"speaker":"拉格纳","content":"没事就好，下次可别傻在原地不动了，要不是戴尔反应快你就危险了。","voice":["vo_event_403101203_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_31012","style":1,"background":2308,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"拉格纳","content":"再遇到怪物你们及时提醒我，我直接开火，绝对不给它们近身的机会。","voice":["vo_event_403101203_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_31012","style":1,"background":2308,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"派尔琪雅","content":"不用……嘶嘶……开火……","voice":["vo_event_403101203_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_31012","style":11,"background":2308,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"content":"不知为何，派尔琪雅的声音有些断断续续，加上无线电中的杂音，你们没能听清具体的内容。","style":3,"background":2308,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"content":"你看向舷窗，她正如常伴游在潜艇边，看不出有什么异常。","style":3,"background":2308,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"speaker":"拉格纳","content":"你说什么？听不清。","voice":["vo_event_403101203_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_31012","style":1,"background":2308,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"speaker":"派尔琪雅","content":"我是说……","voice":["vo_event_403101203_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_31012","style":11,"background":2308,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"content":"沉默半晌，她却只憋出了两个字。","style":3,"background":2308,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"speaker":"派尔琪雅","content":"没事……","voice":["vo_event_403101203_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_31012","style":11,"background":2308,"log_type":1}]}